# No upstream push

`upstream` is `https://github.com/reactos/reactos.git`. Do not push commits, tags, or branches there. Do not open a pull request against that repository.

`origin` is this fork, `https://github.com/rjwil1086/reactos.git`. Pushing to `origin` is allowed when the user asks for it.

```text
Wrong: git push upstream HEAD
Right: git push origin HEAD
```
